    Bug 1926711 - Account Hub Density Awareness - Make header/notification bar, body grid, and footer density aware. r=aleca,tobyp

    **How to Test**
    - Open the account hub and use the fastmail account to be able to go through every step
    - The density changes in this patch affect the spacing between the header title and notificaiton bar, the spacing between the header and the body, the spacing of the form elements in the email and password form, and the spacing in the footer
    - Refer to this checklist and comments in the doc to see specific change requests completed, and additional comments https://docs.google.com/document/d/1lO0cAGIShjkZ__DIceLgvT622qJZytmEVF0ik0FjgrM/edit?usp=sharing

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D239952

